.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH search 1  "search " 
.SH NAME
search \- Search items by substring over title, description, design, DoD, and notes. Results are grouped by lane priority (next+in\-progress → blocked → deferred → closed), each group in its natural order; archived items are excluded by default
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsearch\fR [\fB\-\-status\fR] [\fB\-\-type\fR] [\fB\-\-now\fR] [\fB\-\-include\-archived\fR] [\fB\-\-archived\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-sort\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIQUERY\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search items by substring over title, description, design, DoD, and notes. Results are grouped by lane priority (next+in\-progress → blocked → deferred → closed), each group in its natural order; archived items are excluded by default
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-status\fR \fI<STATUS>\fR
Filter by status
.TP
\fB\-\-type\fR \fI<TY>\fR
Filter by type, using the active plugin\*(Aqs vocabulary (see `nxf schema`)
.TP
\fB\-\-now\fR \fI<NOW>\fR
Reference time (ISO\-8601 / RFC3339); defaults to now. Sets the defer boundary used to group deferred matches
.TP
\fB\-\-include\-archived\fR
Append the archived group (lowest priority) instead of excluding it
.TP
\fB\-\-archived\-only\fR
Search ONLY the archive; the live lanes are skipped
.TP
\fB\-\-sort\fR \fI<SORT>\fR
Flatten the lane grouping into one order by this key (`rank` | `id` | …). Unknown = loud error
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIQUERY\fR>
Query string
